id: segmented-weight
name: Segmented Weight
kind: crafting
categories: weights
# "Quality Slots: 1~2" - which, asked when it is added.
slots: 1~2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  1 or 2 Quality Slots: the first Doff Bonus each Combat Encounter lasts a Combat Round longer
  for each.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Automatic, 1/Encounter]: For each Quality Slot this Quality occupies, increase the duration
  of the Doff Bonus for doffing this piece of Apparel for the first time in a Combat Encounter
  by 1 Combat Round.
text: >
  Segmented Weight: You can remove these weights in increments, or all at once.
  –Apparel Category: Weights
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1~2
  –Effects: For each Quality Slot this Quality occupies, increase the duration of the Doff
  Bonus for doffing this piece of Apparel for the first time in a Combat Encounter by 1 Combat
  Round.

---

# --- What is built -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Its Slots: 1 or 2, asked when it is added and shown on its row.
#
# Its Doff Bonus lasts a Combat Round longer for each Slot this takes - always the first time it
# is doffed in an Encounter, since a piece gives its Doff Bonus once an Encounter.

[passive]
piece.doffRounds += $slots;
